WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.800
The 16 at the top of this column is the total of the two squares below it.

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.400
Two different numbers that make 16? Only 7 and 9.

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.800
Across, the top run makes 8. A 9 there would leave nothing for its partner, so it is 7, then 9 below and 1 beside it.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.600
Every number follows from the last. No guessing.
